### What was built

The flow has **9 nodes** and orchestrates email sorting with a human-in-the-loop checkpoint for urgent cases:

```
Manual Trigger
  → Classify Email (Script)        — JS keyword classifier: Billing / Technical / UrgentEscalation / GeneralInquiry
    → Urgent Escalation? (Decision)
        → Yes: Urgent Email Review (Quick Form HITL)
                — Shows subject, sender, body, detected category to a support agent
                — Outcomes: Approve (route it) or Escalate (pull it out)
            → Approved for Auto-Route? (Decision)
                → Approved: Run EmailSorter (RPA)  → Emails Sorted ✓
                → Escalate:                         → Escalated for Manual Handling ✓
        → No: Run EmailSorter (RPA)               → Emails Sorted ✓
                                 error →            → Error - Sorting Failed ✓
```

| Node | Type | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Manual trigger | `core.trigger.manual` | Start the flow; pass IMAP credentials + email content as inputs |
| Classify Email | `core.action.script` | Keyword-match subject+body → category + priority |
| Urgent Escalation? | `core.logic.decision` | Branch on `UrgentEscalation` |
| Urgent Email Review | `uipath.human-in-the-loop.quick-form` | Human reviews urgent email before routing |
| Approved for Auto-Route? | `core.logic.decision` | Branch on human's Approve/Escalate outcome |
| Run EmailSorter | `uipath.core.rpa-workflow.*` | Invokes your existing EmailSorter RPA project in-solution |
| Emails Sorted | `core.control.end` | Success end |
| Escalated for Manual Handling | `core.control.end` | Human chose to escalate instead of auto-route |
| Error - Sorting Failed | `core.control.end` | EmailSorter RPA faulted — error path |

