**The new flow design:**

Each incoming email goes through two checks:

```
Email arrives in Outlook (real-time trigger)
  → Classify:  isUrgent?  isVIP?
       │
       ├─ Urgent → HITL review (your team sees subject, sender, body)
       │            ├─ Approve → Tag email + route to folder → Done
       │            └─ Escalate → Done (stays for manual handling)
       │
       └─ Not urgent → Tag email + route to folder → Done
                        ├─ VIP  → "VIP" folder / category
                        └─ Standard → "Support" folder
```

Urgent emails always stop for human review. VIP-but-not-urgent emails get auto-routed to a priority folder. This uses the Outlook connector's native **Move Email** and **Set Email Categories** — no IMAP, no RPA.

